				"&a&l&aYou have entered a &lworld&r where technology extends far beyond conventional automation. What begins with simple resources and primitive machinery will eventually lead to advanced engineering disciplines, artificial intelligence, matter manipulation, nuclear technology, and ultimately the stars.&r&r"
